#. Body of the restore confirmation, when the last change turned off all your signals in every chat. {time} is when, such as 11:58 PM or 9 Nov, 11:58 PM.
msgid "Puts back what you had on before you turned all off at {time}. What you have on there now goes off."
msgstr "מחזיר את מה שהיה מופעל לפני כיבוי הכול ב-{time}. מה שמופעל שם עכשיו ייכבה."

#. Body of the restore confirmation when the signal last set everywhere has since been taken off the bar. {time} is when, such as 11:58 PM or 9 Nov, 11:58 PM.
msgid "Puts back what you had on before your last change everywhere at {time}. What you have on there now goes off."
msgstr "מחזיר את מה שהיה מופעל לפני השינוי האחרון בכל מקום ב-{time}. מה שמופעל שם עכשיו ייכבה."

#. Body of the restore confirmation, when the last change was itself a restore, so this one swaps back. {time} is when, such as 11:58 PM or 9 Nov, 11:58 PM.
msgid "Puts back what you had on before your last restore at {time}. What you have on there now goes off."
msgstr "מחזיר את מה שהיה מופעל לפני השחזור האחרון ב-{time}. מה שמופעל שם עכשיו ייכבה."

#. Body of the restore confirmation, when the last change set one signal in every chat. {label} is the signal name, such as Sleeping; {time} is when, such as 11:58 PM or 9 Nov, 11:58 PM.
msgid "Puts back what you had on before {label} everywhere at {time}. What you have on there now goes off."
msgstr "מחזיר את מה שהיה מופעל לפני הפעלת {label} בכל מקום ב-{time}. מה שמופעל שם עכשיו ייכבה."

#. Screen reader description of the QR code in the "Get the Tyne app" panel.
#. Screen reader description of the QR code in the "Get the Tyne app" panel.
msgid "QR code that opens the Tyne download page"
msgstr "קוד QR שפותח את דף ההורדה של Tyne"

